[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15187.429, "timestamp": "04:13:07", "text": "我的天哪"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15188.46, "timestamp": "04:13:08", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15190.469, "timestamp": "04:13:10", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15192.07, "timestamp": "04:13:12", "text": "很好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15194.309, "timestamp": "04:13:14", "text": "来找我，我会让你复活。 我甚至不会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15196.87, "timestamp": "04:13:16", "text": "复活你们这些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15198.63, "timestamp": "04:13:18", "text": "小鬼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15207.03, "timestamp": "04:13:27", "text": "哦，大家都这么说。 于是我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15209.59, "timestamp": "04:13:29", "text": "打了声招呼。 他们说其中一个人说了声“你好”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15212.229, "timestamp": "04:13:32", "text": "或者“你好”之类的话。 我回应了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15214.71, "timestamp": "04:13:34", "text": "你好，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15216.309, "timestamp": "04:13:36", "text": "然后他们就好像在问“那是谁啊”，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15221.91, "timestamp": "04:13:41", "text": "还问“那是谁啊”之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15225.83, "timestamp": "04:13:45", "text": "然后最后一个人说，呃，"}]